# Build context of the apps/api and apps/web images (context = repository root, T4.7).
# Secrets never enter a build context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
# Rebuilt inside the image; host copies would be the wrong platform (amd64 on the laptop).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/dist-scripts
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
# Not needed by any image, and some of it is large or holds local data.
.git
.claude
.cursor
data
apps/ai
tools
eval/datasets
eval/runs
eval/probes
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
apps/api/.test-data
infra
docs
